    "Apple 健康" : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Apple Health"
          }
        },
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Apple Health"
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Appleヘルスケア"
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Apple 건강"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Apple 健康"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Garmin Connect、华为运动健康、Zepp、Wahoo、Keep、Strava 等都会把运动写进 Apple 健康，勾选后即可导入，无需分别登录。导入的记录只读取不修改，删除本地记录不会影响对方的数据。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Garmin Connect, Huawei Health, Zepp, Wahoo, Keep, Strava und andere schreiben Workouts in Apple Health – du kannst sie hier importieren, ohne dich einzeln anzumelden. Importierte Einträge werden nur gelesen; ein Löschen hier verändert die Daten der anderen App nicht."
          }
        },
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Garmin Connect, Huawei Health, Zepp, Wahoo, Keep, Strava and others all write workouts to Apple Health, so you can import them here without signing in to each one. Imported workouts are read only — deleting a record here never touches their data."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Garmin Connect、Huawei Health、Zepp、Wahoo、Keep、Strava などはワークアウトを Apple ヘルスケアに書き込むため、個別にログインしなくても取り込めます。取り込んだ記録は読み取り専用で、こちらで削除しても相手のデータには影響しません。"
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Garmin Connect, 화웨이 건강, Zepp, Wahoo, Keep, Strava 등은 운동을 Apple 건강에 기록하므로 각각 로그인하지 않아도 가져올 수 있습니다. 가져온 기록은 읽기 전용이며, 여기서 삭제해도 원본 데이터에는 영향이 없습니다."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Garmin Connect、華為運動健康、Zepp、Wahoo、Keep、Strava 等都會把運動寫進 Apple 健康，勾選後即可匯入，無需分別登入。匯入的記錄只讀取不修改，刪除本機記錄不會影響對方的資料。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
